            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [{ "type": "paragraph", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Put the flour in a bowl. Add the eggs and milk. Whisk to a thick batter. Season with salt and pepper." }] }]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [{ "type": "paragraph", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Add the mashed peas, cheddar, spring onion, and green chilli. Stir to combine. The batter should be thick and hold its shape." }] }]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [{ "type": "paragraph", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Heat the oil in a frying pan over a medium heat. Spoon heaped tablespoons of batter into the pan. Press down slightly. Cook in batches of 3 or 4." }] }]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [{ "type": "paragraph", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Fry for 3 minutes per side until golden and set through. Lift onto kitchen paper to drain. Serve hot." }] }]
